{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2020b.q23.material.recovered", "text": "在一次关于学生个体差异的研讨会上，一位小学校长将学生比喻成鲜花，他说：“有的学生是适时盛开的花朵，有的学生是还未开放的花苞。只要给予足够的阳光、空气、水分及耐心的等待，未开的花苞总会开放，而且有的迟开的花苞盛开时可能会更加鲜艳、更长久。我们要用静待花开的心态去对待孩子，接受他，尊重他，这样才能帮助他，促进他。”", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a9f6db89d5b62174de7a7d7940beaeb400e61d823eb79da5e79c1f6908a4bd7", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1838, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1994, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9a9f6db89d5b62174de7a7d7940beaeb400e61d823eb79da5e79c1f6908a4bd7"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2020b.q23"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m2.k1"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r017"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2020b.q23"], "word_count": 156, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a9f6db89d5b62174de7a7d7940beaeb400e61d823eb79da5e79c1f6908a4bd7", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1838, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1994, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9a9f6db89d5b62174de7a7d7940beaeb400e61d823eb79da5e79c1f6908a4