{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2020b.q24.material.recovered", "text": "李老师批改五年级学生作文时，看到小勇的作文不足200字，而且字迹潦草，错别字不少，这样的作文打60分也就差不多了。但李老师想，只给一个分数对作文成绩一直不高的小勇不会有什么触动。于是，李老师经过认真思考，给他打了“100-25-15”，并附上文字说明：你的作文选材新颖，有真情实感，但是字数不足，层次不清，减", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a9f6db89d5b62174de7a7d7940beaeb400e61d823eb79da5e79c1f6908a4bd7", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2052, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2206, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9a9f6db89d5b62174de7a7d7940beaeb400e61d823eb79da5e79c1f6908a4bd7"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2020b.q24"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m5.k02", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m7.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.design", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.evaluate"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r001", "ntce.outline.202.r031", "ntce.outline.202.r044", "ntce.outline.202.r045", "ntce.outline.202.r046"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2020b.q24"], "word_count": 154, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9a9f6db89d5b62174de7a7d7940beaeb400e61d823eb79da5e79c1f6908a4bd7", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2052, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2206, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.